OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses raise concerns over hot
OL,4,Aworkplace bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in West Yorkshire have
OL,7,Fraised concerns over a private members
OL,8,Fbill to introduce maximum workplace
OL,9,Ftemperatures. If passed, the
OL,10,Flegislation would set up an independent
OL,11,Fbody to make recommendations to the
OL,12,Fgovernment so that workplaces are safe
OL,13,Ffor employees, including changing
OL,14,Fworking hours or being able to work
OL,15,Ffrom home.
OL,17,FJin Chu, who runs a tearoom in Wetherby
OL,18,Fsays she understands the bill's
OL,19,Fintention, but that adapting her
OL,20,Femployees working hours could lose her
OL,21,Fmoney.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
