OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses raise concerns over hot
OL,4,Aworkplace bill
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If we had to close for one day because
OL,7,Fof the heat, the minimum day for
OL,8,Frunning is #1,000.
OL,10,F"Add the staff wages we'd still pay,
OL,11,Fthat's altogether #2,000 gone."
